test_explicit_ids_route_home (tests.test_sc_got_aep_2026_11_25l.GotRoutingTests.test_explicit_ids_route_home) ... PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-AEP-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Shax t593u sets the method (structure, not one-to-one; archetypes recombine across eras like a Nephilim composite) but no threshold for when a resemblance counts. Chosen default: a composite correspondence is recorded as a CANDIDATE only when at least three structural attributes are shared, at least one of them relational (what the figure does to or with others, not a name, look or title), and at least one difference is recorded. Each attribute is tracked separately as inheritance, recombination and outcome. Below the threshold the row is WEAK or NAME_BORROWING. A candidate is never proof of transmission or literal identity.
