PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-GOT-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. t593u asks whether the dragons are the missing third force between the living and the dead. Chosen default: the dragons are an amplifier, not a faction. Their role follows the relationship with whoever holds them (Daenerys's liberation and conquest; the Night King's wight Viserion), the same rule as SC-VESSEL-SPN-001 (role by relationship). In SC-TRIAD-001 terms the living hold the binary (Preservation: Cersei and the old order; Transformation: Daenerys) and the dead hold the outside-owner position on the consent axis only.
