PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-GOT-JON-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Shax's question (t593u): is Jon our Jesus, or the vessel carrying the archetype while the story distributes Christ's functions across several characters? Chosen default under SC-AEP-001: distributed. Of the eight attributes in the t593u bundle, Jon carries five, two partly and one inverted; the defeat of death goes to Arya (she kills the Night King, 8x03) and the crown to Bran (elected, 8x06). Jon is a composite, not 'the' figure.
