PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WORTHY-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. t603u places Thor's worthiness beside the Usurped-Shard pattern and Guardian's Fall and says each tests a different property of authority, but does not say whether worthiness is a separate pattern or a gate inside one of them. Chosen default: the worthiness invariant (capability is not legitimate authority; authority to wield must be verified independently of the wielder's own claim) is a separate reading under SC-AEP-001, related to but not merged into SC-SHARD-001 (captured authority) or SC-GUARD-001 (protective authority turning coercive), and it is not an invariant class. The alternatives (fold it into SC-SHARD-001 as the pre-capture gate; promote it to an invariant class) remain open.
