PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-VESSEL-CAIN-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Shax's key question (t589u): can a person inherit the consequences of an ancient conflict without inheriting the guilt or the obligation to continue it? Chosen default: yes. Consequences transfer (the Mark's effects; the Darkness released when it was removed). Guilt does not transfer (Ezek 18:20; Deut 24:16). An obligation cannot bind an heir without the heir's own consent (Consent Invariant, SC-CONSENT-001: voluntary and revocable). Open tension: Exod 20:5 and 34:7 speak of iniquity visited on later generations, so the scripture text points both ways.
