test_explicit_ids_route_home (tests.test_sc_wow_theology_2026_11_25m.WowRoutingTests.test_explicit_ids_route_home) ... PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WOW-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. The brief asks whether SC-TRIAD-001 (preservation, assimilation, transformation) fits Warcraft as Order/Void/Death or as Titans/Old Gods/Jailer. Chosen default: the triad fits on the consent axis, not on the cosmic-force axis. Assimilation is the Void (Old Gods' whispers, the Black Empire, Black Blood, Xal'atath's bargains). Preservation and transformation are stances found inside every force (the Titans order and also reserve a re-origination; Death judges and the Jailer remakes; the Light shelters and also coerces), so neither is assigned to one force. The Burning Legion is annihilation, the same fourth kind of outside party left open in SC-GOT-001.
PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WOW-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. The brief asks whether SC-TRIAD-001 (preservation, assimilation, transformation) fits Warcraft as Order/Void/Death or as Titans/Old Gods/Jailer. Chosen default: the triad fits on the consent axis, not on the cosmic-force axis. Assimilation is the Void (Old Gods' whispers, the Black Empire, Black Blood, Xal'atath's bargains). Preservation and transformation are stances found inside every force (the Titans order and also reserve a re-origination; Death judges and the Jailer remakes; the Light shelters and also coerces), so neither is assigned to one force. The Burning Legion is annihilation, the same fourth kind of outside party left open in SC-GOT-001.
