PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WOW-CLASS-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Shax (t594u) asks for 'all the invariants and classes of World of Warcraft'. A class can be sorted by the force it draws on (Light, Void, fel, arcane, nature, death) or by how it relates to that power. Chosen default: sort by relationship to the power source (SELF, CHANNEL, BOND, PACT, MEDIATION, STEWARDSHIP, CONSUMPTION, LIBERATED_VESSEL, CREATED_THEN_FREED), because the same force appears under several relationships (Light: Paladin channels it by oath, Blood Knights took it from a captive naaru; Void: Shadow Priest channels, Devourer Demon Hunter consumes). Tradition rows are SC-AEP-001 candidates only, and a row that shares only a name is marked NAME_BORROWING.
PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WOW-CLASS-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Shax (t594u) asks for 'all the invariants and classes of World of Warcraft'. A class can be sorted by the force it draws on (Light, Void, fel, arcane, nature, death) or by how it relates to that power. Chosen default: sort by relationship to the power source (SELF, CHANNEL, BOND, PACT, MEDIATION, STEWARDSHIP, CONSUMPTION, LIBERATED_VESSEL, CREATED_THEN_FREED), because the same force appears under several relationships (Light: Paladin channels it by oath, Blood Knights took it from a captive naaru; Void: Shadow Priest channels, Devourer Demon Hunter consumes). Tradition rows are SC-AEP-001 candidates only, and a row that shares only a name is marked NAME_BORROWING.
