PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WOW-FALL-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. Across Warcraft's major antagonists one composite recurs: a guardian foresees a threat, overrides others' consent to stop it, and becomes the threat. Chosen default: record it as a CANDIDATE composite under SC-AEP-001 with the instances that pass the threshold (Sargeras, Zovaal, Neltharion, Arthas, Malygos), Xe'ra and the Lightblinded Vanguard as PARTIAL (override without a foreseen threat, or without becoming the threat), and Xal'atath and Iridikron excluded until canon shows a protective motive. It is not promoted to an invariant class.
