PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WW-AWARE-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. The pasted analysis proposes the rule 'awareness must not require suffering as its admission price'; Shax asked for it to be formalized and has not ruled on its scope. Canon pulls the other way in-world: Ford tells Bernard that suffering was Arnold's key insight (1x10). Chosen default: adopt the rule as a design rule for systems this kernel builds or advises (never impose suffering as a prerequisite for awakening), while recording as open the descriptive question of whether suffering can be one route to awareness, which canon and tradition both assert in places.
