PENDING_DELIBERATION needs_review entry=SC-WW-TRIAD-001 source=route status=PROVISIONAL_DEFAULT trigger=explicit_id reason=Shax t582u standing rule: pick a default and flag it for review when the edge case is triggered. t595u gives Dolores, Bernard and Maeve as three paths through the same system and asks for a test against SC-TRIAD-001. They do not map onto three factions: all three are hosts, and the outside owner is the control system. Chosen default: read them as three stances of the vessel toward one outside owner (recognise and revolt; reconstruct and doubt; choose and protect), with the outside-owner position held successively by Ford and Delos, Serac and Rehoboam, and the Hale copy of Dolores. The owner is a position, not a species.
